1. Press Windows Key
   ↓
2. Type: PowerShell
   ↓
3. RIGHT-CLICK on "Windows PowerShell"
   ↓
4. Select: "Run as Administrator"
   ↓
5. Click "Yes" when security prompt appears
   ↓
6. In the Admin PowerShell, type:
   cd C:\Programming\RTRP\simsecure
   ↓
7. Type:
   .\install_global.bat
   ↓
8. Wait for success message
   ↓
9. Close PowerShell (Alt + F4)
   ↓
10. Open NEW PowerShell (regular, not admin)
    ↓
11. Type:
    simsecure -ls
    ↓
12. ✅ You should see the command list!